Package: zeroclaw-agent
Version: 0.8.0
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Jason Perlow <jason.perlow@gmail.com>
Depends: podman
Description: ZeroClaw Hive Worker (Podman Quadlet)
 Deploys the official ZeroClaw Rust agent via Podman Quadlet.
 This package isolates the agent to the 4 small, high-efficiency cores
 (CPUs 4-7) on the Cix Sky1 processor, ensuring it never competes with
 heavy LLM or database workloads on the 8 big cores.
